                        :
                        <span>{word.obj.eDesc}</span>
                      )                        
                    }
                    </div>
                    </Grid.Column>
                    <Grid.Column>
                    <div>
                    {word[3] != null && bestHitIndex == 3 ?
                      <span dangerouslySetInnerHTML={{__html: fuzzysort.highlight(word[3], '<i>', '</i>')}}></span>
